              "content": "## Home Context Memory\n\nPrivate, local continuity for Assist. Durable saves are explicit. Session topics expire after 30 days. This dashboard shows metadata only; saved text is not displayed here. The separate Home Context + ChatGPT Control trial sends selected context to ChatGPT and retains the full control capability configured on Chat GPT New."
