          "cards": [
            {"type": "tile", "entity": "sensor.chatgpt_context_brief", "name": "Context supplied"},
            {"type": "tile", "entity": "sensor.chatgpt_context_categories", "name": "Context categories"},
            {"type": "markdown", "content": "The combined trial delegates ordinary requests to Chat GPT New through Home Assistant. It retains that agent's configured full-control capability and normal confirmations. The memory integration adds no custom device tools."}
